              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhuluma kuwe usenenhlanhla; kodwa wena wathi: Kangifuni ukuzwa. Lokhu kwakuyindlela yakho kwasebusheni bakho, ukuthi awuzange ulalele izwi lami.",
          "type": "text",
