              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena owakhileyo eLebanoni, owakha isidleke sakho emisedarini, yeka ukuthi uzakuba lesihawu lapho ubuhlungu bukwehlela, ubuhlungu bobelethayo!",
          "type": "text",
